{
    "$schema": "https://images.onerom.org/configs/schema.json",
    "version": 1,
    "name": "Oric-1",
    "description": "Tangerine Oric-1 ROMs - Tangerine Extended Basic v1.0, v1.1 and v1.22 (UK) sourced from https://cdn.oric.org and Oric Diagnostic ROM v1.08 sourced from https://oric.signal11.org.uk.",
    "detail": "Instructions:\n1. Install One ROM 28 in IC9 socket\n2. Use Jumpers A (1) + B (2) as required, 0 = Ext Basic v1.0, 1 = Atmos Ext Basic v1.1, 2 = Atmos Ext Basic v1.22 (Unofficial), 3 = Diagnostics c1.08\n3. Power on the computer and enjoy!\n \nTroubleshooting: If you experience power on reset issues it is suggested that C21 is upgraded from 1uF electrolytic capacitor to 100/150uF see https://github.com/sodiumlb/ocula-docs/wiki/OCULA-User-Manual#system-reset for more info.",
    "categories": [
        "computer",
        "firmware",
        "bios",
        "oric-1",
        "tangerine",
        "atmos",
        "basic",
        "diagnostic",
        "UK"
    ],
